DCC - forked into devsys on 2026-10-02 from ~/projects/dcc/CoCoC
(Source/Compiler/{CPP,CC09,COpt,DCC}): commit 68fdbf9 plus the owner's
uncommitted changes in that working tree, saved as uncommitted-at-fork.patch
(CPP dues.c/lex.c/parse.c, COpt inst.c/labels.c/optim.c, CC09/GNUmakefile,
DCC/dcc.c). Left out: object files, built binaries, and the *-orig.c /
*-old.c backup copies. No upstream history kept.

Build each part with "make -f GNUmakefile" in CPP, CC09, COpt and DCC.
harness/dccdiff.py compares this build with CoCoC's on every C source.

Changes (phase 6, docs/DESIGN.md D18):
  CC09  identifiers significant to 31 characters (NAMESIZE, was 8); symbol
        entries keep room for 8 and grow only for longer names; full names
        in the assembly; fixed: getword's buffer overflow, settype leaving
        the dimension list unset and an unterminated dimension chain
        (crash on XLisp/xlkmap.c)
  COpt  labels up to 32 characters (LABELSIZE, was 11); fixed: "puls u"
        read two bytes before its operand
  DCC   runs las instead of rma
Design and roadmap: ../docs/DESIGN.md
